kes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"2009799672240517613":{"a":"<p>Thought Experiment: What if you wanted to systematically erase the evidence of the owners of the land you just bought. Create expos, dig out the debris, polish it all up, and then at the end of the the expo auction off all the parts to the highest bidder. Repeat over and over…</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/2009794059800387786\">https://x.com/i/status/2009794059800387786</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 2009799672240517613</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2009799672240517613\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2026-01-10T01:29:16Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"2009801376751116740":{"a":"<p>So where did it all go?  Half of Egypt is in England, no?</p>\n<p>Deconstruct the civilization in America and ship to Europe from 1890-1910s. Bomb out a bunch of damaged cities from 1915-45 in Europe and rebuild the new cities from the parts of old cities stolen from America. Pretend…</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/2009799672240517613\">https://x.com/i/status/2009799672240517613</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 2009801376751116740</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/2009801376751116740\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2026-01-10T01:36:03Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"2009804161261752631":{"a":"<p>Any evidence of this? East Coast: DC, New York, etc made from Indiana stone. I think you would find a lot more Indiana stone out in the world if you looked closely.  Pardon, the technical term is Salem Limestone. Ahem. Let&#x27;s ask Melchizedek for an opinion...</p>\n<blockquote class=